# The ear (GEAR.md G4): the listener's core over one ear. Over the shoulder, a
# machine winds up behind a house the eye cannot see past: bare, its tell ring
# is hidden by the house; with the ear it is drawn through it.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/ear.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --view=shoulder --fit=hat_brim,mod_listen
#   (and without --fit, for the frame it is set against)
coast calm
place spawn
wait 1.0
near house
wait 0.8
spawn cutter beyond house
wait 0.6
tell cutter
wait 0.2
shot 01-a-tell-behind-the-house with mob:cutter
